<title>GREECE: EIB 5-yr FRN 9th coupon set at 11.41 pct.</title>
<headline>EIB 5-yr FRN 9th coupon set at 11.41 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bayerische Vereinsbank-Athens, agent for the European Investment Bank's (EIB) five-year drachma FRN issued March 15 1995, said the note's ninth coupon was set at 11.41 percent.</p>
<p>The coupon is for the period March 17 1997 - June 17 1997. The capped floater is due in the year 2000.</p>
<p>&quot;As per the terms and conditions of the note, the coupon is based on the three-month Athibor on March 13 1997 -- 11.81 percent,&quot; Bayerische Vereinsbank said.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
